Subject: [v2 PATCH 11/14] spi/atmel_spi: correct 16 bits transfer with DMA
Date: Tue,  4 Dec 2012 15:53:57 +0800
Message-Id: <1354607640-13229-12-git-send-email-wenyou.yang@atmel.com>
